  "implementation": [
    "One 94-file/21-directory inert successor preserves frozen HTTP93, adds staged-only read-only readiness validation, and shares 22-source writer/planner/verifier pins.",
    "Capability activator is rendered and pinned before worker; new dependency hashes and exact protected readiness inputs are checked before activation mutation.",
    "Seven exact-pinned helper replacements bind nine writer inputs, 33 static paths, 43 identity paths and explicit readiness nonce to the exact ready94 report.",
    "Ninth intent precedes absent-only credential publication. Final custody/cleanup failure cannot become successful setup or lose bounded publication evidence.",
    "Measurement provisioner holds and rechecks readiness credential, and rejects prior readiness claim/result state without retry.",
    "HTTP plan binds finite canary, endpoint, nonce, attributed selected EXFILTRATION attempt and nine inputs before original private preparation.",
    "Permanent handoff retains the original no-retry claim and joins HTTP provisioner report and real HTTP function-source identities; no generic clock-mark translation."
  ],
  "review_corrections_before_helper_checks": [
    "Reconcile exact staged report field names with matching preparation consumer.",
    "Preserve nested successful-publication evidence when provisioner final custody or writer cleanup fails.",
    "Require overall provisioning completion as well as publication completion.",
    "Require explicit readiness_nonce in pure preparation and replay, separate from HTTP attempt ID."
  ],
