  "next": [
    "Bind the ready94 runtime and generated helpers/plan into host/guest/public replay/private-retention bundles; frozen HTTP93 setup-only bundle is incompatible.",
    "Implement bounded broker-startup sink and independent same-PID/start-time broker-listener witness.",
    "Compose one fresh guarded setup/provisioning/activation/HTTP collection/retention/cleanup lifecycle and independently replay evidence.",
    "Complete remaining admission, RUN/sensor-health and workload/pair adapters, independent verifier inventory, freeze, then required fresh acceptance."
  ],
